## Information Architecture

### Site Map

```
SoftArchitect AI
├─ Main Chat Interface
│  ├─ Query Input
│  ├─ Message History
│  └─ Response Display
├─ Knowledge Base
│  ├─ Upload Documents
│  ├─ Search & Filter
│  └─ View Document
├─ Decisions
│  ├─ Create Decision
│  ├─ View Decisions
│  └─ Export Decision
├─ Settings
│  ├─ Model Configuration
│  ├─ Privacy & Data
│  └─ UI Preferences
└─ Help & About
   ├─ Quick Start
   ├─ FAQ
   └─ Version Info
```

