## Component States

### Query Input Component

```
DEFAULT STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Type your question...                    │
│ [Character count: 0/5000]       [Send]  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

FOCUSED STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 🔵 ← Focus ring                          │
│ |Type your question here...              │
│ [Character count: 0/5000]       [Send]  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

TYPING STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ How to choose between React and Vue?     │
│ [Character count: 42/5000]      [Send]  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

SUBMITTING STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ How to choose between React and Vue?     │
│ [Character count: 42/5000]      [⏳...]  │
│ (disabled input, grayed button)          │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

DISABLED STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ (grayed out)                             │
│ [Character count: 0/5000]    [Send]     │
│ (cannot interact - Ollama offline)       │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Response Display Component

```
LOADING STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ ⏳ Generating response...                │
│ [████░░░░] 45% Processing context       │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

STREAMING STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ React is a JavaScript library...         │
│ It provides components for building      │
│ user interfaces. Vue is similar...       │
│                                          │
│ [▁▂▃ Typing...]                         │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

COMPLETE STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ React is a JavaScript library...         │
│                                          │
│ Key differences:                         │
│ 1. Template syntax                       │
│ 2. Learning curve                        │
│ 3. Ecosystem                             │
│                                          │
│ Recommendation: React for scale          │
│                                          │
│ [Copy] [Save] [👍] [👎]                 │
│ Source: React Docs (0.95), Vue (0.91)   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

ERROR STATE:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ ❌ Error: Ollama not responding          │
│ Please ensure Ollama is running          │
│ [Retry] [Settings]                      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

