## Design System Colors

### Palette

```
Primary Colors:
  Accent Blue: #3B82F6 (interactions)
  Dark Gray: #1F2937 (backgrounds)
  White: #FFFFFF (text)
  Light Gray: #F3F4F6 (borders)

Semantic Colors:
  Success: #10B981 (green)
  Error: #EF4444 (red)
  Warning: #F59E0B (orange)
  Info: #3B82F6 (blue)

Themes:
  Dark (default)
  Light (optional)
  High Contrast (accessibility)
```

